{{!-- The one loud thing on the page, and it is his sentence rather than ours:
     the Over page is a long, warm, slightly rambling story, and this is the line
     from it that says what he is about. It closes the page before the footer, on
     the deeper maroon the client's own theme used for its rules and veils.

     The words are a theme setting, so he can change or empty them - an empty
     quote renders an empty band, which is why it is worth saying in Design that
     this one is optional. --}}
{{#if @custom.over_quote}}
<section class="band bg-primary-deep">
    <div class="page">
        <blockquote class="m-0 mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center font-heading text-[clamp(1.25rem,2.4vw,1.75rem)] leading-[1.35] font-medium text-background text-balance">
            &ldquo;{{@custom.over_quote}}&rdquo;
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</section>
{{/if}}
